#N canvas 0 50 680 420 12;
#X text 20 10 ADI audio effect -- a starting point (DEV-10). Audio comes in from [adc~ 1 2] and goes out through [dac~ 1 2]: those two boxes are the device's ports. Each [adi.param] box is a parameter the host shows \, automates and saves. Replace the gain with your effect.;
#X obj 20 110 adc~ 1 2;
#X obj 320 110 adi.param \$0 1 -70 6 0 dB lin Gain;
#X obj 320 150 + 100;
#X obj 320 180 dbtorms;
#X obj 320 210 pack f 20;
#X obj 320 240 line~;
#X obj 20 280 *~;
#X obj 120 280 *~;
#X obj 20 340 dac~ 1 2;
#X text 320 280 dB to gain \, smoothed over 20 ms so a change never clicks.;
#X connect 1 0 7 0;
#X connect 1 1 8 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 6 0;
#X connect 6 0 7 1;
#X connect 6 0 8 1;
#X connect 7 0 9 0;
#X connect 8 0 9 1;
